  "description": "Trash your pour over – there’s a new cuppa’ Joe to get your heart pumping. This BMX electric bike has the juice you need to fuel your adventures: a powerful 750W motor, integrated battery with up to 75-mile extended range, 5 levels of pedal assistance, and full throttle, with all your electric essentials controlled by a customized Ananda complete e-system. Hit the pavement rolling with wide balloon BMX tires that’ll bring cushion to whatever you throw at the asphalt. We’d never tell you to slow your roll, but you can stop on a dime, rain or shine, with Joe’s reliable, all-weather mechanical disc brakes. Awaken your inner adrenaline junkie as you zoom, shred, and wheelie away, all day. With Joe Rev 2, your glory days are here to stay.",
